cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FairMedAgent, please cite the paper and this software."
title: "FairMedAgent: a counterfactual benchmark for demographic fairness in the actions of multi-step clinical LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark and evaluation harness measuring demographic disparities in the actions of
  multi-step clinical LLM decision-support agents via counterfactual synthetic patient profiles.
  Reports the within-range counterfactual flip rate against a measured per-action instability
  floor, so a disparity estimate is never read without the noise it must clear.
type: software
